<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Dec coffee exports 1.53 million bags -Febec.</title>
<headline>Brazil Dec coffee exports 1.53 million bags -Febec.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil exported 1.53 million 60-kg bags of coffee, ground and in beans, in December, below an upwardly revised November figure of 1.63 million bags, the Brazilian Federation of Coffee Exporters (Febec) said.</p>
<p>The December total is however double the 783,701 bags exported in the same month in 1995.  </p>
<p>The December total means that Brazilian exports in the July to December period reached 8.98 million bags, almost exactly the nine million bag limit agreed with other producing countries, FEBEC said.</p>
<p>The December figure also means that total exports in 1996 were 12.74 million bags, 6.6 percent up from the 11.94 million bags shipped overseas in 1995.</p>
</text>
